/* What every screen used to write for itself. A screen links it straight after the palette:

       <Style src="../Palette.uss" />
       <Style src="../UI/Base.uss" />

   Linking it is also what puts a screen under the seal: scripts/check_ui.py holds any screen that links
   Base.uss to layout-only stylesheets. See UI.md. */

:root {
    -unity-font: url("project://database/Assets/Kinesthetic/Rehab/Fonts/Nunito-SemiBold.ttf");
    -unity-font-style: normal;
    color: var(--slate-70);
}

Label { margin: 0; padding: 0; }

.hidden { display: none; }
